{"2797640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rogue Night", "steam_appid": 2797640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797640/extras/54a54174b2a276e584c8dc6c58178bb1.poster.avif?t=1776911663\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797640/extras/54a54174b2a276e584c8dc6c58178bb1.webm?t=1776911663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong> Explore a huge world and dive into dungeons full of monsters, puzzles, and traps to find powerful weapons, rare rings, blueprints, tools, and of course, gold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Your Weapons:</strong> Choose from 20 weapons, each with its own combat feel and a utility outside of combat. Daggers can pick locked chests, war hammers can break cracked blocks, whips grapple walls and cliffs, crossbows ignite barrels, and more. Level them up through combat to unlock their full power.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797640/extras/5b50f0b66618d4950eab9dadbf618738.poster.avif?t=1776911663\" width=616 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797640/extras/5b50f0b66618d4950eab9dadbf618738.webm?t=1776911663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797640/extras/5b50f0b66618d4950eab9dadbf618738.mp4?t=1776911663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization:</strong> Build your hero with 3 distinct classes, 20 weapons that level up as you progress, 15 enchanted rings, and more than 35 upgrades, allowing you to craft a character that perfectly matches your style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a Base:</strong> Gather resources, rescue survivors, and turn a simple campfire into a fortified town. Your survivors will provide resources and fight for you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797640/extras/4a3550004e20928f275d1f9e66896556.poster.avif?t=1776911663\" width=616 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797640/extras/4a3550004e20928f275d1f9e66896556.webm?t=1776911663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797640/extras/4a3550004e20928f275d1f9e66896556.mp4?t=1776911663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rogue-lite Progression:</strong> Death is not the end. Collect the heads of zombies to buy permanent upgrades at the Witch Between Worlds. Choose normal mode for steady progress, or permadeath for a greater challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quest &amp; Conquer:</strong> Navigate through traps and puzzles in dungeons to uncover the fate of the fallen heroes of Elandris and confront Necrosarian the Vile in a final battle for the Everrun.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797640/extras/604a4b05cea0a97105ada84745141034.poster.avif?t=1776911663\" width=616 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_